---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="How to Help — Base Impact" description="Ways to support Base Impact's mission to help neighbors get connected in Brevard County, FL.">
  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-body mb-4 fade-in">How to Help</h1>
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-muted leading-relaxed fade-in">
    <p>There are many ways to support Base Impact's work in Brevard County.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Donate</h2>
    <p>Base Impact is a pre-filing nonprofit. Donations help us provide devices, internet service, and digital skills training to neighbors who need them.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Volunteer</h2>
    <p>Share your skills — tech setup, training, or just being present. See our <a href="/volunteer" class="text-accent font-semibold">volunteer page</a> for details.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Spread the word</h2>
    <p>Tell neighbors, churches, and community groups about the resource directory. The more people who know, the more people we can help.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mt-6">Partner</h2>
    <p>If your organization serves Brevard County, we'd love to work together. See our <a href="/partners" class="text-accent font-semibold">partners page</a>.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-lg bg-fill px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-on-fill hover:bg-fill-hover">Get in touch</a>
  </div>
</Base>
